    "description": "Execute basic actions on the last observed window. A standalone prepare_window action explicitly adjusts its client area in dip96 and returns the measured result; inspect again before input. control_id clicks prefer direct UIA invocation; pointer input restores focus. Points use the last state's coordinateSpace (image_pixels when a screenshot was returned, otherwise window pixels). Mapping is internal. Stops on failure without replay.",
